# Emulator: lginit_app2 initialises TV hardware. Only emit its event, after the one directory of
# its start-up that a later job needs: tvservice touches /var/lib/eim/initdone during its own
# start-up (tv_sysonoff_init), which begins on lginit_app-ready.
# webOS 2's job adds a post-stop that starts the reboot job when lginit_app2 ends in a RELEASE
# boot (DEBUG_STATUS 5, board.cmdline's debugMode=): lginit_app2 is not expected to end on a TV, but
# this script does, so the post-stop is emptied.
script
	mkdir -p /var/lib/eim
	initctl emit --no-wait lginit_app-ready
end script

post-stop script
	:
end script
